'''Pigüe''' (Mapudungun pronunciation: [[W:IPA|[piɡu]]]; {{Lang-bl|Pigüey}}) is a [[Regions of Balisca|region]] of [[Cerdanya]] within the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]]. It is bounded by [[Máfil]] to the north, [[Antüko]] to the east, and the [[Willi Mapu]] and [[Küyenmapu]] [[Indigenous nations in Balisca|indigenous nations]] to the south and southwest. It is included in all definitions of [[Rural society in Balisca|Rural Balisca]].

The administrative seat and largest city in Pigüe is [[Chiguayante]].

